<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:ext="http://exslt.org/common"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<title>ITS_AIDR | Jon's Arm Reference</title><meta name="description" content="ITS Architecture Identification Register. Identifies the GIC architecture version to which the implementation conforms."></meta><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"></meta><link rel="stylesheet" href="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.css"></link><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/static/normalize.css"></link><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/static/main.css"></link></head><body><p class="discontinuation-notice" data-pagefind-ignore="all"><b>PER ARM'S REQUEST, THIS SITE WILL BE DISCONTINUED ON 4 DECEMBER 2026. :(</b><br></br>

      Arm's lawyers have notified me to take down this site or face legal action. <br></br>

      To all of the fans of this site over the years (even the ones at Arm): thank you for your support! I'm glad I could provide a resource so many people found value in. I will look into solutions that can potentially keep bookmarks and links working. <br></br>

      — Jon
    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="register-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">ITS_AIDR</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">ITS Architecture Identification Register</p><div data-pagefind-body="1">
        <p>ITS Architecture Identification Register. Identifies the GIC architecture version to which the implementation conforms.</p>
      </div><h3>Configuration</h3><p>This register is present only when FEAT_GICv5_EXT is implemented. Otherwise, direct accesses to ITS_AIDR are <span class="arm-defined-word">RES0</span>.</p><h3>Attributes</h3>
        <p>ITS_AIDR is a 32-bit register.</p>
      <p>This  register is part of the <a href="its_config_frame.html">ITS_CONFIG_FRAME</a> block.</p><h2>Field descriptions</h2><table class="regdiagram" id="fieldset_0"><thead><tr><td>31</td><td>30</td><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>27</td><td>26</td><td>25</td><td>24</td><td>23</td><td>22</td><td>21</td><td>20</td><td>19</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>16</td><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>13</td><td>12</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>7</td><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="firstrow"><td class="lr" colspan="20"><a href="#fieldset_0-31_12">RES0</a></td><td class="lr" colspan="4"><a href="#fieldset_0-11_8">Component</a></td><td class="lr" colspan="4"><a href="#fieldset_0-7_4">ArchMajorRev</a></td><td class="lr" colspan="4"><a href="#fieldset_0-3_0">ArchMinorRev</a></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="fieldset_0-31_12">Bits [31:12]:
      </h4><div class="field">
      <p>Reserved, <span class="arm-defined-word">RES0</span>.</p>
    </div><h4 id="fieldset_0-11_8">Component, bits [11:8]:
      </h4><div class="field">
      <p>GIC component</p>
    <table class="valuetable"><tr><th>Component</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="bitfield">0b0000</td><td>
          <p>IRS</p>
        </td></tr><tr><td class="bitfield">0b0001</td><td>
          <p>ITS</p>
        </td></tr><tr><td class="bitfield">0b0010</td><td>
          <p>IWB</p>
        </td></tr></table></div><h4 id="fieldset_0-7_4">ArchMajorRev, bits [7:4]:
      </h4><div class="field">
      <p>Major Architecture revision.</p>
    <table class="valuetable"><tr><th>ArchMajorRev</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="bitfield">0b0000</td><td>
          <p>GICv5.x</p>
        </td></tr></table></div><h4 id="fieldset_0-3_0">ArchMinorRev, bits [3:0]:
      </h4><div class="field">
      <p>Minor Architecture revision.</p>
    <table class="valuetable"><tr><th>ArchMinorRev</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="bitfield">0b0000</td><td>
          <p>GICv5.0</p>
        </td></tr></table></div><div class="access_mechanisms"><h2>Access Instructions</h2><p>Accesses to this register use the following encodings:</p><div class="access_block"><p>Accessible at offset <span class="hexnumber">0x0044</span> from ITS_CONFIG_FRAME</p></div><p>Accesses to this register are <span class="access_level">RO</span>.</p><p style="text-align: right">
      ()
      </p></div><hr class="bottom_line"></hr><p class="copyconf">Version 2026.09 — Copyright © 2010-2026 Arm Limited or its affiliates.</p><small>This site is provided as a community resource and is NOT affiliated with nor endorsed by Arm Limited.</small><!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics --><script defer src='https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js' data-cf-beacon='{"token": "de55e78a4e194365a81a0724c5c0ee91"}'></script><!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics --></body></html>
